WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.927
We got some 
fresh fish, fellas!

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:12.846
Welcome to my jail, son.

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:17.308
You're in here
cause they say you gotta pay.

00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:20.103
I'm in here to 
make sure you do.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:21.187
Congratulations, Adams.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:23.481
You are a father.

00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:25.358
Nobody told you?

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.068
You’re going to spend the rest of your life in here. 

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:28.403
You ain't never 
going to see that-

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:29.404
(screams)

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:32.407
Truth is,

00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:34.743
I never thought 
about being a father.

00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:37.620
He’s a little mama's boy.

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:38.455
You know,
you don't have to

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:40.081
be like him, right?

00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:40.790
Look, 
I just want to

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:41.416
be there for my kid.

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:48.048
If freedom’s a state of mind,

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:50.050
I guess my dreams 
should be enough.

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:52.886
Just think about
 how much better

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.221
your kid’s going to 
be without you around.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.393
Bosco, when are 
you gonna grow up?

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:06.024
I ain't content with dreaming.

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:09.360
Humans are 
the greatest weakness

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.945
in any security system.

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:13.948
Prisons aren’t inescapable, 

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:15.909
they’re just meant 
to feel that way.

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:22.040
Need your help.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.041
I know the game bro.

00:01:27.378 --> 00:01:28.463
You think reading is going to save your ass?

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:29.964
No, I do not, sir.

00:01:29.964 --> 00:01:31.049
I’m straight G.

00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:31.925
Have at it.

00:01:32.717 --> 00:01:34.761
I am so close to 
not only freedom,

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.471
but also being a real father.

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.182
I would like to help you.

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:41.601
I want that more than anything in the world.

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:51.486
(screams)

00:01:55.949 --> 00:01:57.992
You can only protect yourself
by your choices. 

00:01:58.993 --> 00:02:00.036
Oh my gosh.

